OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after bow and arrow
OL,4,Afired in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a bow and
OL,7,Farrow was fired in the street in a West
OL,8,FYorkshire village.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a man
OL,11,Fthrowing rubbish and household items
OL,12,Fout of a car he was driving on
OL,13,FHuddersfield Road in Skelmanthorpe, at
OL,14,Fabout 17:30 BST on Tuesday.
OL,16,FIt was then reported the man had got
OL,17,Fout of the car and was firing a bow and
OL,18,Farrow at passing vehicles. No one was
OL,19,Fhurt but a number of vehicles were
OL,20,Fdamaged, West Yorkshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
